stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle: actor created in MongoDB
  Idle --> Active: successful message
  Active --> Active: successful message
  Active --> Idle: status set to idle
  Idle --> Active: status set to active
  Idle --> Migrating: rebalance starts
  Active --> Migrating: rebalance starts
  Migrating --> Idle: ownership transfer succeeds
  Migrating --> Idle: conflict recovery completes
